## Install as /etc/audit/rules.d/99-finalize.rules - LAST, after a soak period.
## Makes the loaded rules immutable until reboot: an attacker with root can no
## longer silently remove them, but neither can you. Every rule change after
## this needs a reboot, and `augenrules --load` fails with "Operation not
## permitted" until then.
-e 2
